# NKERP (Hajj & Umrah Tour Management ERP) - Project Summary

## 📋 Project Overview

**Project Name:** NKERP (Nijam Khadra ERP)
**Type:** Enterprise Web Application / ERP System
**Purpose:** A comprehensive ERP system for managing Hajj and Umrah tour operations, including applicant management, visa processing, partner registration, transport management, accommodation, and financial transactions.
**Industry:** Travel & Tourism (Religious Tourism - Hajj/Umrah)
**Deployment:** Docker-based containerized deployment with Nginx

